      "en": "It is one of its favourite uses. In a bathroom it faces fewer knocks and acidic liquids than in a kitchen, and its beauty comes fully into its own. A few precautions are enough: up-to-date sealing, wiping away toothpaste and cosmetics, and gentle cleaning products rather than acidic descalers. We cut the top with all the basin and tap cut-outs.",
