      "en": "Act fast: blot without rubbing, then clean with water and pH-neutral soap. Never use vinegar or any acidic product, which would attack the stone. If the mark is a dull ring left by an acid, the surface itself has been etched: contact us or a stone professional for suitable restoration.",
