      "en": "Yes. We work with many professionals, including kitchen designers, architects and builders. Your kitchen designer can send us their drawings, choose the material with you and decide whether our teams fit the worktop or they handle it themselves. Trade customers enjoy preferential terms and a dedicated contact to follow the order.",
